// Title: PUA - Restic Backup Tool Execution
// Rule ID: 6ddff2e8-ea1a-45d0-8938-93dfc1d67ae7
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.exfiltration, attack.t1048, attack.t1567.002
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_pua_restic.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
